%20which%20are%20older%2C%20legacy,cloud%2C%20maintaining%20or%20enhancing%20legacy%20systems%2C%20or%20designing%20or%20acquiring%20new%20systems.","q":"These investments involve replacing existing systems, some of which are older, legacy systems, outsourcing certain technology and business processes to third-party service providers, including the adoption of Generative AI in certain processes, making changes to existing systems including the migration of applications to the cloud, maintaining or enhancing legacy systems, or designing or acquiring new systems."},"s:794367:2023:0":{"f":"#:~:text=These%20investments%20involve%20replacing%20existing%20systems%2C%20some%20of%20which%20are%20older%2C%20legacy,cloud%2C%20maintaining%20or%20enhancing%20legacy%20systems%2C%20or%20designing%20or%20acquiring%20new%20systems."},"f:794367:2024":{"f":"#:~:text=These%20investments%20involve%20replacing%20existing%20systems%2C%20some%20of%20which%20are%20older%2C%20legacy,cloud%2C%20maintaining%20or%20enhancing%20legacy%20systems%2C%20or%20designing%20or%20acquiring%20new%20systems.","q":"These investments involve replacing existing systems, some of which are older, legacy systems, outsourcing certain technology and business processes to third-party service providers, including the adoption of Generative artificial intelligence (\"AI\") in certain processes, making changes to existing systems including the migration of applications to the cloud, maintaining or enhancing legacy systems, or designing or acquiring new systems."},"s:794367:2024:0":{"f":"#:~:text=These%20investments%20involve%20replacing%20existing%20systems%2C%20some%20of%20which%20are%20older%2C%20legacy,cloud%2C%20maintaining%20or%20enhancing%20legacy%20systems%2C%20or%20designing%20or%20acquiring%20new%20systems."},"s:794367:2024:1":{"f":"#:~:text=AI%20creates%20business%2C%20legal%20and%20ethical%20challenges."},"s:794367:2024:2":{"f":"#:~:text=We%20use%20AI%20as%20a,customer%20experience%20and%20operational%20efficiency."},"s:794367:2024:3":{"f":"#:~:text=AI%20tools%20assist%20us%20in%20areas%20such%20as%20customer,personalization%2C%20coding%2C%20human%20resources%20queries%2C%20security%2C%20marketing%20and%20advertising."},"s:794367:2024:4":{"f":"#:~:text=We%20include%20AI%20in%20our%20annual%20compliance%20training%20and,requiring%20internal%20review%20and%20approval%20for%20certain%20AI%20tools."},"s:794367:2024:5":{"f":"#:~:text=Even%20with%20careful%20governance%2C%20use%20of%20AI%20can%20produce,confidential%20information%2C%20reflect%20biases%2C%20or%20violate%20intellectual%20property%20rights."},"s:794367:2024:7":{"f":"#:~:text=To%20achieve%20these%20goals%2C%20the%20Company%20is%20focused%20on%20outsourcing%20opportunities%2C%20process,machine%20learning%2C%20and%20Artificial%20Intelligence%20%28%22AI%22%29%20and%20Generative%20AI%2C%20into%20our%20business."},"f:794367:2025":{"f":"#:~:text=We%20are%20applying%20artificial%20intelligence%20to%20how%20customers%20discover%2C,through%20intelligent%20shopping%20assistance%2C%20agentic%20commerce%20and%20hyper%2Dpersonalized%20experience.","q":"We are applying artificial intelligence to how customers discover, shop and engage with our brands through intelligent shopping assistance, agentic commerce and hyper-personalized experience."},"s:794367:2025:0":{"f":"#:~:text=We%20are%20applying%20artificial%20intelligence%20to%20how%20customers%20discover%2C,through%20intelligent%20shopping%20assistance%2C%20agentic%20commerce%20and%20hyper%2Dpersonalized%20experience."},"s:794367:2025:1":{"f":"#:~:text=We%20are%20also%20experimenting%20with%20AI%20in%20merchandising%2C%20planning,to%20optimize%20inventory%20and%20demand%20decisions%2C%20among%20other%20uses."},"s:794367:2025:2":{"f":"#:~:text=If%20our%20competitors%20are%20able%20to%20deploy%20AI%20technology,faster%2C%20we%20could%20lose%20competitive%20advantage%20or%20market%20share."},"s:794367:2025:3":{"f":"#:~:text=These%20investments%20involve%20replacing%20existing%20systems%2C%20some%20of%20which%20are%20older%2C%20legacy,cloud%2C%20maintaining%20or%20enhancing%20legacy%20systems%2C%20or%20designing%20or%20acquiring%20new%20systems."},"s:794367:2025:5":{"f":"#:~:text=We%20use%20AI%20as%20a,customer%20experience%20and%20operational%20efficiency."},"s:794367:2025:6":{"f":"#:~:text=AI%20tools%20assist%20us%20in%20areas%20such%20as%20customer,personalization%2C%20coding%2C%20human%20resources%20queries%2C%20security%2C%20marketing%20and%20advertising."},"s:794367:2025:7":{"f":"#:~:text=We%20include%20AI%20in%20our%20mandatory%20compliance%20training%2C%20maintain%20guidelines%20requiring%20internal,approval%20for%20certain%20AI%20tools%20and%20monitor%20AI%20systems%20for%20proper%20functioning."},"s:794367:2025:8":{"f":"#:~:text=Even%20with%20careful%20governance%2C%20use%20of%20AI%20can%20produce%20incorrect%20output%2C%20release,unintentional%20discrimination%2C%20or%20generate%20output%20that%20violates%20intellectual%20property%20rights%20of%20others."},"s:794367:2025:9":{"f":"#:~:text=The%20autonomous%20nature%20of%20agentic%20AI%20may%20present%20challenges%20in%20aligning%20with,testing%20protocols%2C%20and%20increase%20risk%20that%20agents%20may%20learn%20to%20circumvent%20guardrails."},"s:794367:2025:10":{"f":"#:~:text=We%20also%20face%20uncertainty%20regarding,or%20state%20regulation%20of%20AI."},"s:794367:2025:11":{"f":"#:~:text=In%20addition%2C%20AI%20tools%20may,more%20sophisticated%20methods%20of%20cyberattacks."},"s:794367:2025:12":{"f":"#:~:text=We%20opened%20our%20new%20state%2Dof%2Dthe%2Dart%20fulfillment%20and%20store%20replenishment,automation%2C%20robotics%20and%20artificial%20intelligence%20into%20our%20delivery%20ecosystem."},"f:81061:2025":{"f":"#:~:text=The%20Company%20continues%20to%20implement%20strategic%20business%20and%20technology%20initiatives%2C%20and%20assesses,artificial%20intelligence%20%28AI%29%2C%20as%20part%20of%20the%20execution%20of%20these%20core%20strategies.","q":"The Company continues to implement strategic business and technology initiatives, and assesses the use of artificial intelligence (AI), as part of the execution of these core strategies."},"s:81061:2025:0":{"f":"#:~:text=The%20Company%20continues%20to%20implement%20strategic%20business%20and%20technology%20initiatives%2C%20and%20assesses,artificial%20intelligence%20%28AI%29%2C%20as%20part%20of%20the%20execution%20of%20these%20core%20strategies."},"s:81061:2025:1":{"f":"#:~:text=The%20use%20of%20AI%20and%20related%20technologies%20could%20result,of%20cybersecurity%20threats%20impacting%20the%20Company%E2%80%99s%20information%20technology%20systems."},"s:81061:2025:2":{"f":"#:~:text=The%20Company%20continues%20to%20implement%20strategic%20business%20and%20technology%20initiatives%2C%20and%20assesses%20the%20use%20of%20AI%2C%20as%20part%20of%20the%20execution%20of%20these%20core%20strategies."},"f:84129:2020":{"f":"#:~:text=Persaud%20has%20served%20on%20the%20National%20Association%20of%20Chain%20Drug%20Stores%E2%80%99%20board,as%20a%20board%20advisor%20for%20Profitect%2C%20an%20AI%20and%20prescriptive%20analytics%20company.","q":"Persaud has served on the National Association of Chain Drug Stores\u2019 board of directors and as a board advisor for Profitect, an AI and prescriptive analytics company."},"s:84129:2020:0":{"f":"#:~:text=Persaud%20has%20served%20on%20the%20National%20Association%20of%20Chain%20Drug%20Stores%E2%80%99%20board,as%20a%20board%20advisor%20for%20Profitect%2C%20an%20AI%20and%20prescriptive%20analytics%20company."},"f:84129:2021":{"f":"#:~:text=Persaud%20has%20served%20on%20the%20National%20Association%20of%20Chain%20Drug%20Stores%E2%80%99%20board,as%20a%20board%20advisor%20for%20Profitect%2C%20an%20AI%20and%20prescriptive%20analytics%20company.","q":"Persaud has served on the National Association of Chain Drug Stores\u2019 board of directors and as a board advisor for Profitect, an AI and prescriptive analytics company."},"s:84129:2021:0":{"f":"#:~:text=Persaud%20h